Precomputing: a balanced number uses digits 1–9 only (0 would need to appear 0 times, so it cannot appear). Choose a subset of digits d whose sum is at most 7, and each digit d in the subset appears exactly d times. For each subset, generate the distinct permutations of the resulting multiset.

